WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.080
This is Centaur.

2
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:07.110
A CRM with AI agents built in, that do the sales admin for your team.

3
00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:10.260
Alex is a rep who starts the day already up to date.

4
00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:14.760
Centaur lines up what needs attention, with the most important tasks first.

5
00:00:14.930 --> 00:00:17.430
Meanwhile, the Centaur agents have been busy:

6
00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:22.910
drafting replies, opening deals, updating them from email, and preparing meeting briefs.

7
00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:24.320
Here's one of them now.

8
00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:27.600
Hannah, at Granite Learning Trust, sent an inquiry.

9
00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:32.350
She has a sales team of forty, currently using Pipedrive, asking about pricing.

10
00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:35.600
The agent replied, and asked the two questions that matter:

11
00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:38.170
how many users do you have, and by when.

12
00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:39.970
Hannah answered the questions.

13
00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:42.690
Budget agreed, live before Christmas.

14
00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:45.980
So the agent offered a call with Cody, and booked it in.

15
00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:48.830
Then, Centaur did all the admin.

16
00:00:49.010 --> 00:00:52.050
It created the account, the contact and the deal,

17
00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:56.840
set the value from the email thread, and noted Pipedrive as the incumbent product.

18
00:00:57.070 --> 00:00:59.160
It qualified the deal against BANT.

19
00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:00.820
Nobody typed a thing.

20
00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:04.250
As things change, Centaur keeps the deal up to date.

21
00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:06.600
Before the call, Hannah writes again:

22
00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:11.850
55 users now, signing by December 15th, and they're also looking at HubSpot.

23
00:01:12.020 --> 00:01:17.680
The agent flags HubSpot as a risk, adds it as a competitor, and refreshes the deal summary.

24
00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:20.430
Then it suggests the new value and close date.

25
00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:22.750
One click each, and the deal is current.

26
00:01:23.140 --> 00:01:24.810
And you stay in control.

27
00:01:25.130 --> 00:01:30.490
Every draft waits for your approval, until you're happy to let the agents send on their own.

28
00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:32.550
Centaur CRM.

29
00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:34.540
Give your sales team their time back.

30
00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:38.150
Book a demo at centaurcrm.com.
